    "ss_feature_15_atJbU4": {
      "type": "ss-feature-15",
      "blocks": {
        "item_Hm7hUG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "atc",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/refill_standalone_icon_21f9ff32-aa80-4d32-8071-9c1e9707d47d.svg",
            "heading": "Starts as a Freestanding Candle",
            "text": "<p>Each refill begins as a freestanding candle designed to fit inside a compatible vessel. No permanent container is included, allowing you to choose the vessel that works best for your space.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Refill_Amber_Tumbler2_015253d5-f9e1-4f32-b1f3-2b16cb5800e9.jpg"
          }
        },
        "item_TXp9yw": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "shield",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/melting_refill_icon_a642dd1a-fea6-4c3d-8a1c-d8ba6903c896.svg",
            "heading": "Collapses Into Place",
            "text": "<p>As the candle burns, the outer wax wall gradually softens and settles into the shape of the container. This creates the familiar experience of a traditional container candle.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Refill_Howdy_SS_2.png"
          }
        },
        "item_my3JNy": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "atc",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/refill_burning_icon_fe758cb1-1bb6-4f68-9af2-922522bb9f9c.svg",
            "heading": "Burns Like a Traditional Candle",
            "text": "<p>Once settled, the refill burns much like a conventional container candle while continuing to use the vessel you already own.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Refill_Howdy_SS_1.png"
          }
        },
        "item_gqwFEH": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "atc",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/another_refill_icon_bcc6fa6b-30d8-42b1-863f-4b8ab31c2de8.svg",
            "heading": "Ready for Another Refill",
            "text": "<p>After the candle is finished, remove the remaining wax and wick tabs, clean the vessel, and begin again with a new scent.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2026-06-16_at_11.52.13_AM.png"
          }
        }
      },
